## Cause

The refresh token expired because the clock skew check compared local time with UTC. The refresh token expired because the clock skew check compared local time with UTC. The refresh token expired because the clock skew check compared local time with UTC. The refresh token expired because the clock skew check compared local time with UTC. The refresh token expired because the clock skew check compared local time with UTC. The refresh token expired because the clock skew check compared local time with UTC. The refresh token expired because the clock skew check compared local time with UTC.

## Fix

The check now converts both sides to UTC before comparing and allows thirty seconds of skew. The check now converts both sides to UTC before comparing and allows thirty seconds of skew. The check now converts both sides to UTC before comparing and allows thirty seconds of skew. The check now converts both sides to UTC before comparing and allows thirty seconds of skew. The check now converts both sides to UTC before comparing and allows thirty seconds of skew. The check now converts both sides to UTC before comparing and allows thirty seconds of skew.

